# Language-model optimization

Load [optimization-loop](../skills/optimization-loop/SKILL.md) and follow it. The ceiling is tok/s for prefill or decode. The 90% test compares the printed rate on that phase with the kernel ceiling. Do not apply this rule to an image pipeline.
